Z||000006||TwisT||05-31-2000||09:13 PM||||Alright,  alright,  alright...  LOL...  you guys crack me up!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>There seems to be some pre-judging going on here.  Realize,  a low-milage '88 GT is NOT a common item.  Second,  the car is displayed AS IT SITS RIGHT NOW,  not necessarily as it will be when sold.  Third...  the price is $4500 OBO,  which us common folk know is "OR BEST OFFER."  I would take less for the car now as is,  however when it is finished I will be less likely to "deal."<P>$4500 is average retail,  by the way...  <P>...Looking for an individual to work with on it,  that's all...  thanks for the sarcasm guys!<P>Later!<P>  ||||reg||1
